# A theorem's proposition (reduction_mixin_theorems/theorem,
# mixin_traps/theorem_trap): a Scott sum of five constructors, in order:
# equal, whose two fields are natural expressions (the type
# natural_expression); periodic, whose two fields are a residue (the type
# residue) and a parity (the type parity), n's residue modulo 3 and its
# parity; not_periodic, whose one field is a periodic slot (the type
# periodic_slot) that does not hold; both, whose two fields are
# propositions; and stepped, whose two fields are a Scott integer of
# corpora/library/integer/cbor, the step the search takes, and a
# proposition. Read by its position
# (gezi.contest.corpora.reductions.ReductionMixinTheorems).
λ export
. export
  (λleft right equal periodic not_periodic both stepped. equal left right)
  (λresidue parity equal periodic not_periodic both stepped. periodic residue parity)
  (λslot equal periodic not_periodic both stepped. not_periodic slot)
  (λleft right equal periodic not_periodic both stepped. both left right) λstep check equal periodic not_periodic both stepped. stepped step check
